"Serge Hazanavicius","role":"la voix du monde (voix)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sEAptpSaByeYh4qupKkKPqRN3XZ.jpg"},{"id":149989,"name":"Eye Haïdara","role":"la Reine mère","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lIsjqRGJOIg9mErmsT3S2nbcMMN.jpg"},{"id":48514,"name":"Éric Judor","role":"le cowboy (voix)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iWVPgew1yPFawRTRBz7DcYI3aKt.jpg"},{"id":1674607,"name":"Oudesh Rughooputh","role":"Maharajah (non-crédité)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2yFTGsWfPUh54QZI0ZIW27PbMs7.jpg"},{"id":2280365,"name":"Théo Hellermann","role":"(non-crédité)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2EDC6XHBkO1RZiYQSXZKTepGJrM.jpg"},{"id":2280367,"name":"Manon Koltès","role":"(non-crédité)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j7BKgtygcThA0ShtYIL7jMMPGJg.jpg"},{"id":2107147,"name":"Maxence Huet","role":"(non-crédité)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vd5srz8dB8XzcEaEMxtMgmV5KCE.jpg"},{"id":2280368,"name":"Isabelle Katz Liza Pivert","role":"(non-crédité)"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Il principe dimenticato","overview":"Djibi vive da solo con Sofia, la figlia di 8 anni per cui ogni notte inventa una storia per farla addormentare. Quando Sofia finalmente dorme, le storie prendono vita: in un mondo immaginario, cavalieri, pirati e altri draghi si muovono per salvare la principessa (che è sempre Sofia) e per essere d'aiuto o di impedimento al coraggioso principe (che altri non è che Djibi). Tre anni dopo, l'ingresso di Sofia nel college segna la fine della sua infanzia e le storie di Djibi non hanno più ragione di essere. Mentre nella realtà Djibi dovrà rassegnarsi alla crescita di Sofia, nel mondo delle favole il suo principe dovrà affrontare la più epica delle sue avventure.","tagline":"Crescere è l'avventura più bella"},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Lost Prince","overview":"Djibi lives alone with Sofia, his 8-year-old daughter. Every night, he invents a story to put him to sleep. When Sofia falls asleep, these extraordinary stories come to life somewhere in an imaginary world inhabited by knights, pirates and other dragons. In this world that belongs only to them, Sofia is always the princess to save, and the brave Prince is none other than Djibi himself.  But 3 years later, the entry of Sofia to the college will mark the end of her childhood. To the despair of her father, she no longer needs her stories at night. On the one hand, Djibi will have to accept that his daughter will grow up and move away from him. On the other hand, in the World of Stories, the Prince will have to face the most epic of all his adventures. Find your destiny in a world where it no longer has a place."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Sofia, 8 ans, vit seule avec son père. Tous les soirs, il lui invente une histoire pour l’endormir. Ses récits extraordinaires prennent vie dans un monde imaginaire où l’héroïne est toujours la princesse Sofia, et son père, le Prince courageux. Mais trois ans plus tard, quand Sofia rentre au collège, elle n’a plus besoin de ces histoires. Désarmé, son père va devoir accepter que sa fille grandisse et s’éloigne de lui. Dans leur Monde imaginaire, le Prince va alors devoir affronter la plus épique de toutes ses aventures pour conserver une place dans l’histoire.","tagline":"Grandir est la plus belle des aventures"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9QnAtO2wBJZaMiM2ajz0FrFvOlg.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9QnAtO2wBJZaMiM2ajz0FrFvOlg.png","language":"en","width":2445,"height":1278},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w4JL8PBWruwBBjHUbXpMVB0AY0s.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w4JL8PBWruwBBjHUbXpMVB0AY0s.png","language":"fr","width":571,"height":294},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3KyJBMPEj7TnBpIYt3z9V7S7Qw6.png","previewU